{"page":378,"width":1670,"height":2514,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"438","words":[{"text":"438","x":171,"y":136,"width":56,"height":27}]},{"text":"Chapter 10 7*, 메모리","words":[{"text":"Chapter","x":296,"y":138,"width":113,"height":26},{"text":"10","x":422,"y":138,"width":35,"height":22},{"text":"7*,","x":487,"y":140,"width":39,"height":24},{"text":"메모리","x":535,"y":140,"width":61,"height":23}]},{"text":"즉, 페이징으로 인해 나지는 것을 적당한 수준으로. 제한시기기 위해서는 399,990번","words":[{"text":"즉,","x":296,"y":259,"width":37,"height":33},{"text":"페이징으로","x":351,"y":257,"width":149,"height":35},{"text":"인해","x":517,"y":259,"width":54,"height":34},{"text":"나지는","x":588,"y":259,"width":118,"height":34},{"text":"것을","x":723,"y":259,"width":56,"height":34},{"text":"적당한","x":797,"y":260,"width":87,"height":34},{"text":"수준으로.","x":897,"y":261,"width":122,"height":33},{"text":"제한시기기","x":1038,"y":262,"width":151,"height":34},{"text":"위해서는","x":1211,"y":262,"width":129,"height":34},{"text":"399,990번","x":1356,"y":263,"width":152,"height":33}]},{"text":"중에서 1번 이하의 페이지 폴트가 발생해아 한다. 따리지 페이지 폴트율을 낮게 유지하","words":[{"text":"중에서","x":295,"y":314,"width":87,"height":35},{"text":"1번","x":400,"y":315,"width":45,"height":34},{"text":"이하의","x":460,"y":316,"width":84,"height":34},{"text":"페이지","x":561,"y":316,"width":84,"height":34},{"text":"폴트가","x":661,"y":316,"width":88,"height":33},{"text":"발생해아","x":762,"y":316,"width":118,"height":35},{"text":"한다.","x":892,"y":317,"width":67,"height":35},{"text":"따리지","x":976,"y":318,"width":88,"height":34},{"text":"페이지","x":1082,"y":318,"width":90,"height":34},{"text":"폴트율을","x":1190,"y":318,"width":130,"height":33},{"text":"낮게","x":1336,"y":318,"width":62,"height":34},{"text":"유지하","x":1415,"y":318,"width":95,"height":34}]},{"text":"는 것이 상당히 중요하다. 그렇지 않으면 실질 접근 시간이 거지고 프로세스 수행은 심","words":[{"text":"는","x":294,"y":374,"width":30,"height":31},{"text":"것이","x":340,"y":371,"width":54,"height":35},{"text":"상당히","x":412,"y":372,"width":85,"height":35},{"text":"중요하다.","x":5